OL,3,AProbe begins into why Amazon cargo
OL,4,Aplane overran Miami runway
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials are investigating what caused
OL,7,Fan Amazon cargo plane to overshoot the
OL,8,Frunway after landing at Miami
OL,9,FInternational Airport in a deadly
OL,10,Fincident on Sunday.
OL,12,FFive people were killed and five others
OL,13,Fseriously injured when the plane, which
OL,14,Fwas operated by 21 Air, crashed just
OL,15,Fbefore 14:00 (18:00 GMT). None of the
OL,16,Fgroup have yet been identified.
OL,18,FThe plane, a Boeing 767-300, crossed a
OL,19,Froad beyond the runway and hit several
OL,20,Fvehicles on the ground. It is not yet
OL,21,Fclear whether those who died were in
OL,22,Fthe aircraft, on the ground, or both.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
